{%- comment -%}
  Gold line-art human figure for the gut-skin connection (Nov 12). Each part is tied to a flow step by data-body-step:
  0 gut microbiome (intestines), 1 microbial metabolites (particles), 2 immune signaling (lymph nodes),
  3 systemic circulation (heart and vessels), 4 skin (the outline). assets/theme.js lights the part of the active step;
  hovering or tapping a part selects its step.
{%- endcomment -%}
